199
00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.940
Me peame kõike hoidma tasakaalus.

200
00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:53.550
Ja, ja,
ja tegelikult tegelikult teine

201
00:13:53.650 --> 00:13:56.010
